# node_modules is intentionally NOT excluded: it's git-tracked and vendored
# into the image so the build needs no npm-registry egress (THEA-112). The
# only native dep, argon2, ships N-API prebuilds for linux-x64/arm64 covering
# both glibc and musl; the Dockerfile runs on a glibc base (node:20-bookworm-
# slim, THEA-114) specifically so node-gyp-build resolves the glibc prebuild,
# which needs no extra OS packages — see Dockerfile.
test
.env
.env.*
*.log
npm-debug.log*
